            {
              "text": "On 14 March, the Ashfell slide damaged the lower road.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                3
              ],
              "id": "2a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "On 14 March, warnings were issued for Withel terraces and nearby areas, including a warning explicitly associated with the landslide.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                12
              ],
              "id": "2a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "On 14 March, about 60 households were evacuated from Withel terraces and people were evacuated from Cranmoor.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                14
              ],
              "id": "2a.3"
            },
            {
              "text": "On 16 March, service disruption was reported in Ashfell bench.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                97
              ],
              "id": "2a.4"
            },
            {
              "text": "On 19 March, 60 households were reported displaced from Cranmoor.",
